Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: sun4i-codec: suspend and resume with the system

The driver handles the suspend and resume triggers, but never registers the
power management callbacks that lead to them. During system sleep, the DMA
engine keeps looping the last audio buffer through the output.
---
--- a/sound/soc/sunxi/sun4i-codec.c
+++ b/sound/soc/sunxi/sun4i-codec.c
@@ -2443,6 +2443,7 @@
 	.driver = {
 		.name = "sun4i-codec",
 		.of_match_table = sun4i_codec_of_match,
+		.pm = &snd_soc_pm_ops,
 	},
 	.probe = sun4i_codec_probe,
 	.remove = sun4i_codec_remove,
